    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/modality> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Argumentation>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "Implication";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "If a person is not a member of an associated group and has fewer than 2000 potentially chargeable premises, then small networks of exempt premises are not chargeable.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(a) A person is not a member of an associated group during the whole or a part of a month.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "(2) If each of those potentially chargeable premises are exempt premises in relation to the person for that month.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::argumentation";
