<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-100-ss-5> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/asserts> <https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-100-ss-5-logic-deontic-1>.
<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-100-ss-5-logic-deontic-1> a <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/LogicApplication>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/modality> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Deontic>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "Obligation";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Reporting obligation";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(5) If particular premises are reported as potentially concessional premises in relation to the person for a month; and apart from this subsection, the premises are not potentially concessional premises in relation to the person for the month;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "the premises are taken, for all purposes, to be potentially concessional premises in relation to the person for the month.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::logic::deontic";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/confidence> 1.0000;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/curationStatus> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Proposed>.
<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-100-ss-5> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/asserts> <https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-100-ss-5-logic-deontic-2>.
<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-100-ss-5-logic-deontic-2> a <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/LogicApplication>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/modality> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Deontic>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "Obligation";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Duty to report";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(a) particular premises are reported as potentially concessional premises in relation to the person for a month;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "the person must report the premises as potentially concessional.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::logic::deontic";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/confidence> 1.0000;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/curationStatus> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Proposed>.
<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-100-ss-5> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/asserts> <https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-100-ss-5-logic-deontic-3>.
<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-100-ss-5-logic-deontic-3> a <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/LogicApplication>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/modality> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Deontic>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "Obligation";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Knowledge requirement";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(b) apart from this subsection, the premises are not potentially concessional premises in relation to the person for the month;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "the person must know that the premises are not potentially concessional.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::logic::deontic";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/confidence> 1.0000;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/curationStatus> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Proposed>.
<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-100-ss-5> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/asserts> <https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-100-ss-5-logic-deontic-4>.
<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-100-ss-5-logic-deontic-4> a <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/LogicApplication>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/modality> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Deontic>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "Obligation";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Reasonable diligence requirement";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(c) the person: (i) did not know; and (ii) could not, with reasonable diligence, have ascertained that the premises are not potentially concessional premises in relation to the person for the month;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "the person must have ascertained that the premises are not potentially concessional.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::logic::deontic";
