    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "MUST";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Must report control of local access line or telecommunications network if they have associates.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(7) For the purposes of subsection (6), if:  (a) a person is in a position to exercise control of:  (i) a local access line; or  (ii) a telecommunications network; and  (b) the person has one or more associates; then:  (c) the person is taken to belong to an associated group; and  (d) the associated group consists of the person and those associates; and  (e) the person is the controller of the associated group.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "(7) For the purposes of subsection (6), if:  (a) a person is in a position to exercise control of:  (i) a local access line; or  (ii) a telecommunications network; and  (b) the person has one or more associates; then:  (c) the person is taken to belong to an associated group; and  (d) the associated group consists of the person and those associates; and  (e) the person is the controller of the associated group.";
